# "If you control another Role on it, put that one into the graveyard" (CR 303.7a, 704.5z). Bot2 has a Cursed Courtier, which
# wears Bot2's own Cursed Role, and an Ornithopter. On turn 3 Bot1's first Asinine Antics puts a Cursed Role of Bot1's on each:
# the Courtier now wears two Cursed Roles, one of each player (Bot1 controls two Roles, with its three Moxen and Island: six
# permanents). On turn 5 the second Antics replaces both of Bot1's Roles, which go to the graveyard, with new ones: Bot1 still
# controls two Roles, not four, and Bot2's own Role stays on the Courtier (it has three permanents throughout).

